## Assumption Challenge
alternate vertices considered: runners, gaps, residues, survivor gates,
mirror orbits, gate pairs, dead components, blocker labels, labelled
projection edges, quotient fibers, and proof obligations.
chosen carrier vertices: dead-cover blocker labels with multiplicity
sidecars, especially labels touched by low-rank E/branch gates.
preserved predicate: whether any union of adjacent E/branch gate labels
can remove an edge from the dead-cover projection.
destroyed by scalarization: which labels are private, which labels carry
projection edges, and which terminal route packet remains.

